Looking at this problem, I need to find all functions $f: \mathbb{R} \to \mathbb{R}$ satisfying $f(xy) = f(f(x) + f(y))$ for all real $x, y$.

**Answer Leak Check:** The problem contains no leaked answers or solution sketches. Proceeding to solve.

